#: ../../source/reference/learn/generated/maxframe.learn.contrib.llm.multi_modal.generate.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.learn.contrib.llm.multi\\_modal.generate"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.learn.contrib.llm.multi_modal.generate:1 of
msgid "Generate text with a multimodal LLM from MaxFrame data."
msgstr "基于 MaxFrame 数据，使用多模态大语言模型生成文本。"

#: maxframe.learn.contrib.llm.multi_modal.generate of
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.learn.contrib.llm.multi_modal.generate:3 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Input data used to render one request per row. Template placeholders "
"reference columns by name, for example ``\"{image_url}\"``."
msgstr ""
"用于按行渲染请求的输入数据。模板占位符按列名引用，例如 ``\"{image_url}\"`"
"`。"

#: maxframe.learn.contrib.llm.multi_modal.generate:6 of
msgid "Multimodal generation model instance."
msgstr "多模态生成模型实例。"

#: maxframe.learn.contrib.llm.multi_modal.generate:8 of
msgid ""
"Chat messages template. This is an alias of ``prompt_template`` and takes"
" precedence when both arguments are provided."
msgstr ""
"聊天消息模板。这是 ``prompt_template`` 的别名；当两个参数都传入时，``"
"messages`` 优先生效。"

#: maxframe.learn.contrib.llm.multi_modal.generate:11 of
msgid ""
"Prompt template used to build each request. A list value should follow "
"chat message shape, where message ``content`` may contain plain text, "
"provider-compatible dicts, or ``ContentPart`` values."
msgstr ""
"用于构建每个请求的提示模板。list 形式应遵循 chat message 结构，其中 "
"message 的 ``content`` 可以包含纯文本、provider 兼容的 dict 或 ``"
"ContentPart`` 值。"

#: maxframe.learn.contrib.llm.multi_modal.generate:15 of
msgid ""
"Whether to return the generated text directly when supported by the model"
" executor, instead of the raw provider response."
msgstr "当模型 executor 支持时，是否直接返回生成文本，而不是原始 provider 响应。"

#: maxframe.learn.contrib.llm.multi_modal.generate:18 of
msgid "Additional generation parameters such as temperature or max tokens."
msgstr "额外生成参数，例如 temperature 或 max tokens。"

#: maxframe.learn.contrib.llm.multi_modal.generate of
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.learn.contrib.llm.multi_modal.generate:21 of
msgid ""
"A DataFrame with ``response`` and ``success`` columns. Failed requests "
"store the error message in ``response``."
msgstr ""
"包含 ``response`` 和 ``success`` 列的 DataFrame。失败请求会将错误信息写入"
" ``response``。"

#: maxframe.learn.contrib.llm.multi_modal.generate of
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.learn.contrib.llm.multi_modal.generate:26 of
msgid "示例"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.learn.contrib.llm.multi_modal.generate:27 of
msgid "Build chat messages with text and image URL placeholders:"
msgstr "使用文本和图片 URL 占位符构建 chat messages："

#: maxframe.learn.contrib.llm.multi_modal.generate:52 of
msgid ""
"Use an OSS object URL with explicit storage options when the image is not"
" publicly reachable:"
msgstr "当图片无法公开访问时，使用带显式 storage options 的 OSS 对象 URL："

#: maxframe.learn.contrib.llm.multi_modal.generate:68 of
msgid "备注"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.learn.contrib.llm.multi_modal.generate:69 of
msgid ""
"``ContentPart.image`` supports ``IMAGE_URL``, ``BINARY`` and ``BASE64`` "
"image content. ``BINARY`` and ``BASE64`` inputs must include "
"``mime_type``."
msgstr ""
"``ContentPart.image`` 支持 ``IMAGE_URL``、``BINARY`` 和 ``BASE64`` 图片"
"内容。``BINARY`` 和 ``BASE64`` 输入必须包含 ``mime_type``。"

